k is to safe your life and leave the ship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful graphics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spectacular fights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good optimization.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 types of weapons. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6-5 levels. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 types of robots. </p></li></ul>",
